      "content": "\"sitting with the emptiness\" sounds like a nice way of saying giving up. and honestly, maybe that's just what i need to do. if i'm as broken as i feel, is there even a point in trying to fight it anymore? it feels like i'm just dragging a weight around that'll never get lighter.",
